tdl v0.20.4 by iyear and contributors
https://github.com/iyear/tdl/releases/tag/v0.20.4

TG NestFetch runs a separately compiled tdl command-line utility. This build
is identified as 0.20.4-nestfetch.2, modified by TG NestFetch on 2026-11-23.
Changes include gotd v0.165.1 for cross-DC QR sign-in, channel attachment
pagination, validation for empty photo sizes, and local video playback.

