This directory includes its LICENSE, the upstream source archive for commit
9d7d49eef2bcb04da720c26e33598c49c68b9ddd, and the corresponding source changes.

Extract the archive and run the following from its root, replacing /path/to/tdl
with the path to this resource directory.

    git apply --unidiff-zero /path/to/tdl/qr-login.patch
    git apply /path/to/tdl/photo-sizes.patch /path/to/tdl/channel-attachments.patch /path/to/tdl/private-preview.patch
    mkdir -p internal/nestfetchpreview
    cp /path/to/tdl/nestfetch-preview-stream.go internal/nestfetchpreview/stream.go
    CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -mod=readonly

